---
# Extends the root configuration rather than replacing it, so this directory runs every
# check the library does except the two below.
InheritParentConfig: true
# The random number generators benchmarked here are file-scope fixtures, constructed once
# and mutated by every iteration: they can be neither const nor function-local without
# moving their construction into what is being measured.
Checks: >
    -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
    -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,
...
